@startuml CU-15
actor "Cliente" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (carrito / mis reservas)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /cart, /reservations" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» CartService / ReservationService / Inventory" as Model

Cli -> UI : Agregar varias prendas al carrito
UI -> Ctrl : POST /cart/items {variant_id, quantity} (varias)
Ctrl -> Model : add_item(db, cart, variant, qty)
Model --> Ctrl : carrito con detalle y total
Ctrl --> UI : CartRead
UI --> Cli : Carrito actualizado

Cli -> UI : Confirmar reserva (check-out) con sucursal
UI -> Ctrl : POST /cart/checkout {branch_id}
Ctrl -> Model : create(db, client, items) → valida stock y reserved_quantity += q
Model --> Ctrl : reserva PENDING + pickup_code + expires_at
Ctrl -> Model : clear(cart)
Ctrl --> UI : ReservationRead
UI --> Cli : Código de recogida y vencimiento mostrados

Cli -> UI : Consultar mis reservas
UI -> Ctrl : GET /reservations/me
Model --> Ctrl : Lista de reservas del cliente
Ctrl --> UI : ReservationRead[]

Cli -> UI : Cancelar una reserva propia
UI -> Ctrl : PATCH /reservations/{id}/status (CANCELLED)
Ctrl -> Model : transition(CANCELLED) → libera stock reservado
Model --> Ctrl : reserva CANCELLED
Ctrl --> UI : ReservationRead

@enduml